[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    314[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// Only the first conversion happens; the rest of stdin is ignored.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    315[0m:[38;5;10m[49m #[test]
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    316[0m:[38;5;10m[49m fn trailing_input_is_ignored() {
