22 tests in [38;5;10mtranslation/tests/differential.rs[0m, none ignored or skipped, all comparing stdout, stderr, and exit status (including death by signal) between the two binaries run as subprocesses. Beyond the enumerated input classes it runs 400 randomized inputs over the byte alphabet [38;5;10m%d[0m branches on, 400 randomized signed digit strings, and every value in [38;5;10m-300..=300[0m plus the ±2 neighborhood of each overflow boundary. Both the debug and release Rust binaries are checked against C on every case.[0m[0m
