I validated the suite by introducing 10 mutations into [38;5;10msrc/main.rs[0m; 9 were caught. The tenth — returning [38;5;10mSome(0)[0m instead of [38;5;10mNone[0m on sign-then-EOF — is genuinely unobservable, since [38;5;10mmain[0m initializes [38;5;10mx[0m to 0, so storing 0 and storing nothing cannot be separated by any input.[0m[0m
